{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-processes-day-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.64, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-processes-day`: EVERY on-road process a county inventory selects, under `<aggregateBy key=\"24-Hour Day\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Year\"/>`: THC, CO and NOx at running exhaust, start exhaust, extended idle and crankcase running, start and extended idle; Total Energy at running exhaust; THC at evaporative permeation, fuel vapor venting and fuel leaks and at refueling displacement and spillage; PM10 and PM2.5 brake and tire wear -- for the passenger car, the light commercial truck and the combination long-haul truck at Washtenaw County SINGLE scale, January and July 2020, both day types, all 24 hours, over the county database of `scale-county-timeagg-day` (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`).\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is every process downstream of PreAggDAY.sql that `scale-county-timeagg-day` did not select: the chained copies (crankcase, refueling, the PM2.5-to-PM10 wear chain) over collapsed parents, brake and tire wear over the collapsed AvgSpeedDistribution, and the evaporative chain over a SampleVehicleTrip whose every trip PreAggDAY.sql moved to hour 0 (PLAN.md §7.3.64).\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs per (county, month, day) cell, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step",
      "evaporative",
      "refueling",
      "crankcase",
      "brake-wear",
      "tire-wear"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-processes-day/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
